a 50% discount available until August 31.\n\n**4. Can I transfer existing US equity holdings to Bitget?**\n\nYes, Stock+ supports inbound transfers from participating brokers, allowing users to consolidate their US equity holdings on the Bitget platform.\n\n**5. Are there any regulatory concerns with Stock+?**\n\nStock+ settles real shares through regulated US brokers, avoiding some of the regulatory uncertainties associated with tokenized stocks. However, users should be aware that ownership claims rely on the broker relationships rather than the exchange itself.\n\n**6. Which brokers does Stock+ use?**\n\nBitget has partnered with regulated brokers including **RQD Clearing** and **Atomic Vaults Securities** to execute trades and handle settlement for Stock+. These partnerships ensure that trades are executed in compliance with US securities regulations, providing an additional layer of security for users.\n\n\n[2 more lines in file. Use offset=70 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1782115960090},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good, the article now has H3 subsections. Let me run the check again:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolusete0cBXC31uR9jWAksPhI93","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"source /tmp/coinography-run-env.sh\nexport RUN_DIR=\"/tmp/coinography-run-20260622-072238-13959-12593\"\n\npython3 ~/.openclaw/workspace-writer/skills/article/autofix_article.py \\\n  --article \"$RUN_DIR/article/final.md\" --no-footer\npython3 ~/.openclaw/workspace-writer/skills/article/check_article.py \\\n  --article \"$RUN_DIR/article/final.md\" \\\n  --research \"$RUN_DIR/research/validated.json\" \\\n  --post-sync"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"zai.glm-5","usage":{"input":58503,"output":142,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58645,"cost":{"input":0.058503,"output":0.00045440000000000004,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0589574}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1782115960094,"responseId":"f